# CampusConnect – Full-Stack Web Application

Developed a full-stack web application designed to support campus-related activities and interactions.
Implemented both the backend and frontend with a clear separation of concerns, enabling real-time data
handling and dynamic user interactions.

The backend manages application logic, data storage, and API endpoints, while the frontend delivers
a responsive and user-friendly interface with a focus on usability and modern UI/UX principles.
The application runs locally as a complete website and supports real data workflows.

This project was developed collaboratively and version-controlled using Git, with extensive commit
history reflecting iterative development, testing, and feature integration.

